[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m1. A factual question — routes to exact XBRL lookup, no model call\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.012, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/ask -d '{\"question\": \"What was Columbia's net income for 2023?\"}'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.094, "o", "  route      \u001b[32mstructured\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m·\u001b[0m matched XBRL concept NetIncomeLoss via 'net income'\r\n  \u001b[2m·\u001b[0m identified company COLB\r\n  \u001b[2m·\u001b[0m identified fiscal year 2023\r\n  \u001b[2m·\u001b[0m concept + company + period form a complete lookup key\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mCOLB NetIncomeLoss for fiscal year 2023 was $348.7 million.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  concept    NetIncomeLoss  =  348,715,000 USD\r\n  period     2023-01-01 .. 2023-12-31\r\n  accession  \u001b[33m0000887343-24-000089\u001b[0m\r\n  source     \u001b[2mhttps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/887343/000088734324000089/0000887343-24-000089-index.htm\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[32m0.9 ms\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m— retrieved 0 passages, called 0 models\u001b[0m\r\n"]
