[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m2. A narrative question — hybrid search, rerank, cited generation\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.012, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/ask -d '{\"question\": \"What are the risks of the Umpqua merger?\"}'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.393, "o", "  route      \u001b[32msemantic\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m· no complete (concept, company, period) key — falls back to search\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Based on the provided filings, the risks associated with the Umpqua\r\n  merger include:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  * **Acquisition and Integration Risks:** Acquisitions may not yield\r\n  anticipated positive results, such as correctly assessing the asset\r\n  quality of acquired assets, managing the total cost of integration\r\n  (including management attention and resources), completing the\r\n  integration in a timely manner, achieving longer-term cost savings,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  profitably deploying acquired funds, or realizing the overall\r\n  performance of the combined entity [1][2].\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  * **Risks if the Merger Agreement is Terminated:**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    * Umpqua's business may be adversely impacted by failing to pursue\r\n  other beneficial opportunities due to management's focus on the\r\n  merger without realizing its benefits [4][5][6].\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    * Significant internal resources devoted to the merger would be\r\n  lost [4][5][6].\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    * The market price of Umpqua's common stock could decline if\r\n  current market prices reflect an assumption that the merger will be\r\n  completed [4][5][6].\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    * Umpqua may be required to pay Columbia a termination fee of\r\n  $145.0 million under certain circumstances [4][5][6].\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mcitations\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(every [n] above resolves to a real filing)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
